# Play test of Mayor's Wharf (CIPlay mayors_wharf, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
island Mayor's Wharf
expect step 0
expect title The Mayor's Safe

# Along the wharf from the islet's beach to City Hall's door: rats in the office
walk 7 -6.3 to 22 -6.3 h=1.4
zone wharf
expect step 1
zone office
expect message full of them
kill Tangaroa rat
expect step 2

# Into the office through its door: the memo
walk 25.5 -6.3 to 25.5 -1 h=1.4
read Mayor's memo
expect step 3

# Up the ladder to the roof and over the walkway to the cafe
climb 23.2 -4.62 h=0.6
expect stand 24 0 h=3.55
walk 24 2 to 24 10 h=4.5

# The flooded floor below: the security locker and its keycard; the vault's reader and shutter; the safe
openat 21.5 -3.5
expect story wharf-keycard 1
expect step 4
use reader
expect message beeps green
expect story wharf-keycard 0
open Mayor's safe
expect item Placeable_Painting_Tangaroa_2 1
expect done
